  "id": "section-861",
  "title": "与外宾谈如何看大字报",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-241.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>241)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　看大字报要一分为二，大多数是革命的大字报，有的是不革命的大字报，有的是坏大字报；有的是符合事实的大字报，有的是不符合事实的大字报。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-240.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-242.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
